1 0 0 1 54 423 Tm (queue, computes basic signal diagnostics, extracts feature frames through either a) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 408 Tm (deterministic or ONNX-backed extractor, and logs metrics. The ?lyrics alignment? parts are) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 393 Tm (still mostly planned types and interfaces, not runtime behavior yet.) Tj
